__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Local GGUF weights for the llm-* compose profiles (large, host-local).
models/
# Local compose overrides (DNS, model selection). Host-specific, never shared.
.env
# Container logs pulled into the tree for analysis (`docker logs llm-intel &>...`).
# Useful to read, never to commit: host-specific, large, and stale within minutes.
*.log
# Local review scratch pad (findings / todo). Working notes, not a repo artifact.
local-todo.md
# `make backup` output. The crown-jewel store: every host the agent has asked for and
# the operator's whole policy — host-local state, never a repo artifact.
backups/
# Claude Code's per-checkout working state: agent worktrees (each one a second copy
# of this repo) and local settings. Ignored WHOLESALE rather than per-entry, which is
# a decision and not laziness — /workspace is bind-mounted read-write, so a committed
# `.claude/` deciding which hooks, agents or skills load would be exactly the
# agent-writable config knob DESIGN.md refuses. The paved road ships in the image
# (claude-sandbox/), and durable per-machine settings live in ~/.config/dockade.
.claude/
